msgstr "Tampilan"

msgid "Automatic"
msgstr "Otomatis"

msgid "Automatic samples colors around the reader. No images are saved."
msgstr "Otomatis mengambil sampel warna di sekitar panel baca. Tidak ada gambar disimpan."

