msgid "Choose the window behind the reader. Desktop permission is required."
msgstr "Pilih jendela di belakang panel baca. Izin desktop diperlukan."

msgid "Choose the window behind your reader in the desktop sharing dialog"
msgstr "Pilih jendela di belakang panel baca dalam dialog berbagi desktop"

msgid "Choosing a language downloads its speech model once, from the model's publisher, and checks it against a fingerprint. Recognition then runs on this computer: nothing you say is sent."
msgstr "Memilih bahasa akan mengunduh model ucapannya sekali dari penerbit model dan memeriksa sidik digitalnya. Pengenalan lalu berjalan di komputer ini: tidak ada ucapan Anda yang dikirim."

msgid "Configure Kalipso…"
msgstr "Konfigurasi Kalipso…"

msgid "Couldn't download %1. Check the internet connection and try again."
msgstr "Tidak dapat mengunduh %1. Periksa koneksi internet dan coba lagi."

